1. Library Book Filter

Class Book:
    Attributes:
        title
        author
        publishYear
        rating

Initialize List<Book> bookList

Function filterBooks():
    Initialize List<Book> filteredBooks
    For each book in bookList:
        If book.publishYear > 2015 AND book.rating > 4.5:
            Add book to filteredBooks
    Return filteredBooks

2. Payment Processor

Interface PaymentMethod:
    Method processPayment()

Class UPI implements PaymentMethod:
    Attributes: upiId
    Method processPayment(): Print "Processing UPI payment"

Class Card implements PaymentMethod:
    Attributes: cardNumber, expiry
    Method processPayment(): Print "Processing Card payment"

Class NetBanking implements PaymentMethod:
    Attributes: bankName, accountNumber
    Method processPayment(): Print "Processing NetBanking payment"

Generic Class Transaction<T extends PaymentMethod>:
    Attribute: T paymentMethod

    Constructor(paymentMethod):
        Set this.paymentMethod

    Method execute():
        Call paymentMethod.processPayment()
